[{"id":"kataba-52-41-4","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"zapisuju","en":"they write (it down)"},{"bs":"i odredi!","en":"and decree!"},{"bs":"propisali smo","en":"we prescribed"},{"bs":"pa ću je odrediti","en":"so I will decree it"}],"ref":"52:41","answerWord":"يَكْتُبُونَ","answerSound":"audio/9ef355231fdec539f29d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or possess they the Unseen so that they can write (it) down?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["أَمْ","عِندَهُمُ","ٱلْغَيْبُ","فَهُمْ","يَكْتُبُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-4-66-2","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"propisali smo","en":"we prescribed"},{"bs":"pišete ga","en":"you (all) write it"},{"bs":"zapisuju","en":"they write (it down)"},{"bs":"propisao si","en":"you prescribed"}],"ref":"4:66","answerWord":"كَتَبْنَا","answerSound":"audio/420034809d29866c9bfa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We had decreed for them: Lay down your lives or go forth from your dwellings, but few of them would have done it; though if they did what they are exhorted to do it would be better for them, and more strengthening;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّا","كَتَبْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","أَنِ","ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","أَوِ","ٱخْرُجُوا۟","مِن","دِيَٰرِكُم","مَّا","فَعَلُوهُ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","وَلَوْ","أَنَّهُمْ","فَعَلُوا۟","مَا","يُوعَظُونَ","بِهِۦ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُمْ","وَأَشَدَّ","تَثْبِيتًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-3-53-6","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa nas upiši!","en":"so record us!"},{"bs":"piše","en":"he/it writes"},{"bs":"propisali smo ga","en":"we prescribed it"},{"bs":"pišete je","en":"you (all) write it"}],"ref":"3:53","answerWord":"فَٱكْتُبْنَا","answerSound":"audio/f046c3894e8a00546638.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Our Lord! We believe in that which Thou hast revealed and we follow him whom Thou hast sent. Enrol us among those who witness (to the truth).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["رَبَّنَآ","ءَامَنَّا","بِمَآ","أَنزَلْتَ","وَٱتَّبَعْنَا","ٱلرَّسُولَ","فَٱكْتُبْنَا","مَعَ","ٱلشَّٰهِدِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-19-79-1","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"napisat ćemo","en":"we will write"},{"bs":"piše","en":"he/it writes"},{"bs":"pa nas upiši!","en":"so record us!"},{"bs":"pa ga napišite!","en":"so (you all) write it!"}],"ref":"19:79","answerWord":"سَنَكْتُبُ","answerSound":"audio/96268ed907a83a03fead.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but We shall record that which he saith and prolong for him a span of torment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["كَلَّا","سَنَكْتُبُ","مَا","يَقُولُ","وَنَمُدُّ","لَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱلْعَذَابِ","مَدًّا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-2-79-18","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"napisala je","en":"she/it wrote"},{"bs":"i pišemo","en":"and we write"},{"bs":"pa neka piše","en":"so let him write"},{"bs":"propisao si","en":"you prescribed"}],"ref":"2:79","answerWord":"كَتَبَتْ","answerSound":"audio/71d04aace0dd96584328.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefore woe be unto those who write the Scripture with their hands and then say, \"This is from Allah,\" that they may purchase a small gain therewith. Woe unto them for that their hands have written, and woe unto them for that they earn thereby.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["فَوَيْلٌ","لِّلَّذِينَ","يَكْتُبُونَ","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","بِأَيْدِيهِمْ","ثُمَّ","يَقُولُونَ","هَٰذَا","مِنْ","عِندِ","ٱللَّهِ","لِيَشْتَرُوا۟","بِهِۦ","ثَمَنًا","قَلِيلًا","فَوَيْلٌ","لَّهُم","مِّمَّا","كَتَبَتْ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","وَوَيْلٌ","لَّهُم","مِّمَّا","يَكْسِبُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-4-81-13","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"piše","en":"he/it writes"},{"bs":"propisali smo ga","en":"we prescribed it"},{"bs":"i pišemo","en":"and we write"},{"bs":"pišete je","en":"you (all) write it"}],"ref":"4:81","answerWord":"يَكْتُبُ","answerSound":"audio/0a8ebe68caba0e0f9b9b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they say: (It is) obedience; but when they have gone forth from thee a party of them spend the night in planning other than what thou sayest. Allah recordeth what they plan by night. So oppose them and put thy trust in Allah. Allah is sufficient as Trustee.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["وَيَقُولُونَ","طَاعَةٌ","فَإِذَا","بَرَزُوا۟","مِنْ","عِندِكَ","بَيَّتَ","طَآئِفَةٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","غَيْرَ","ٱلَّذِى","تَقُولُ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَكْتُبُ","مَا","يُبَيِّتُونَ","فَأَعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","وَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","وَكَفَىٰ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَكِيلًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-7-156-0","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"i odredi!","en":"and decree!"},{"bs":"propisali smo","en":"we prescribed"},{"bs":"napisala je","en":"she/it wrote"},{"bs":"piše","en":"he/it writes"}],"ref":"7:156","answerWord":"وَٱكْتُبْ","answerSound":"audio/52ebe2165e777f671357.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And ordain for us in this world that which is good, and in the Hereafter (that which is good), Lo! We have turned unto Thee. He said: I smite with My punishment whom I will, and My mercy embraceth all things, therefore I shall ordain it for those who ward off (evil) and pay the poor-due, and those who believe Our revelations;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["وَٱكْتُبْ","لَنَا","فِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","حَسَنَةً","وَفِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","إِنَّا","هُدْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","قَالَ","عَذَابِىٓ","أُصِيبُ","بِهِۦ","مَنْ","أَشَآءُ","وَرَحْمَتِى","وَسِعَتْ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","فَسَأَكْتُبُهَا","لِلَّذِينَ","يَتَّقُونَ","وَيُؤْتُونَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-7-156-21","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ću je odrediti","en":"so I will decree it"},{"bs":"i odredi!","en":"and decree!"},{"bs":"pišete ga","en":"you (all) write it"},{"bs":"propisano je","en":"it was prescribed"}],"ref":"7:156","answerWord":"فَسَأَكْتُبُهَا","answerSound":"audio/112a217a940152a24467.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And ordain for us in this world that which is good, and in the Hereafter (that which is good), Lo! We have turned unto Thee. He said: I smite with My punishment whom I will, and My mercy embraceth all things, therefore I shall ordain it for those who ward off (evil) and pay the poor-due, and those who believe Our revelations;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["وَٱكْتُبْ","لَنَا","فِى","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","حَسَنَةً","وَفِى","ٱلْءَاخِرَةِ","إِنَّا","هُدْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","قَالَ","عَذَابِىٓ","أُصِيبُ","بِهِۦ","مَنْ","أَشَآءُ","وَرَحْمَتِى","وَسِعَتْ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","فَسَأَكْتُبُهَا","لِلَّذِينَ","يَتَّقُونَ","وَيُؤْتُونَ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","هُم","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"kataba-36-12-4","words":["verb:kataba"],"options":[{"bs":"i pišemo","en":"and we write"},{"bs":"napisala je","en":"she/it wrote"},{"bs":"propisano je","en":"it was prescribed"},{"bs":"piše","en":"he/it writes"}],"ref":"36:12","answerWord":"وَنَكْتُبُ","answerSound":"audio/fb34543431c3ef90899c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We it is Who bring the dead to life. We record that which they send before (them, and their footprints. And all things We have kept in a clear Register.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pisati, propisati","en":"to write, to prescribe"},"passage":["إِنَّا","نَحْنُ","نُحْىِ","ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","وَنَكْتُبُ","مَا","قَدَّمُوا۟","وَءَاثَٰرَهُمْ","وَكُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","أَحْصَيْنَٰهُ","فِىٓ","إِمَامٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"كَتَبَ"}},{"id":"harrama-2-173-1","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranio je","en":"he/it forbade"},{"bs":"zabranio ih je","en":"he/it forbade them (two)"},{"bs":"zabranjujete","en":"you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"učinio ga je svetim","en":"he/it made it sacred"}],"ref":"2:173","answerWord":"حَرَّمَ","answerSound":"audio/96fd8f3b989229696506.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He hath forbidden you only carrion, and blood, and swineflesh, and that which hath been immolated to (the name of) any other than Allah. But he who is driven by necessity, neither craving nor transgressing, it is no sin for him. Lo! Allah is Forgiving, Merciful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["إِنَّمَا","حَرَّمَ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْمَيْتَةَ","وَٱلدَّمَ","وَلَحْمَ","ٱلْخِنزِيرِ","وَمَآ","أُهِلَّ","بِهِۦ","لِغَيْرِ","ٱللَّهِ","فَمَنِ","ٱضْطُرَّ","غَيْرَ","بَاغٍ","وَلَا","عَادٍ","فَلَآ","إِثْمَ","عَلَيْهِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","غَفُورٌ","رَّحِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-4-160-4","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranili smo","en":"we forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"},{"bs":"zabranio ih je","en":"he/it forbade them (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranio je","en":"and he/it forbade"}],"ref":"4:160","answerWord":"حَرَّمْنَا","answerSound":"audio/a3c37d6db1d27e4812a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Because of the wrongdoing of the Jews We forbade them good things which were (before) made lawful unto them, and because of their much hindering from Allah's way,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["فَبِظُلْمٍ","مِّنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","هَادُوا۟","حَرَّمْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","طَيِّبَٰتٍ","أُحِلَّتْ","لَهُمْ","وَبِصَدِّهِمْ","عَن","سَبِيلِ","ٱللَّهِ","كَثِيرًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-5-96-8","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranjeno je","en":"and it was forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju ga","en":"and they forbid it"},{"bs":"učinio ga je svetim","en":"he/it made it sacred"},{"bs":"zabranjena je","en":"it was forbidden"}],"ref":"5:96","answerWord":"وَحُرِّمَ","answerSound":"audio/bd252fdfa882ad0cceea.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"To hunt and to eat the fish of the sea is made lawful for you, a provision for you and for seafarers; but to hunt on land is forbidden you so long as ye are on the pilgrimage. Be mindful of your duty to Allah, unto Whom ye will be gathered.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["أُحِلَّ","لَكُمْ","صَيْدُ","ٱلْبَحْرِ","وَطَعَامُهُۥ","مَتَٰعًا","لَّكُمْ","وَلِلسَّيَّارَةِ","وَحُرِّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","صَيْدُ","ٱلْبَرِّ","مَا","دُمْتُمْ","حُرُمًا","وَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","ٱلَّذِىٓ","إِلَيْهِ","تُحْشَرُونَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-3-50-10","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjeno je","en":"it was forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuje","en":"and he/it forbids"},{"bs":"zabranio ih je","en":"he/it forbade them (two)"},{"bs":"učinio ga je svetim","en":"he/it made it sacred"}],"ref":"3:50","answerWord":"حُرِّمَ","answerSound":"audio/74fee3e38e0810c8aeca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (I come) confirming that which was before me of the Torah, and to make lawful some of that which was forbidden unto you. I come unto you with a sign from your Lord, so keep your duty to Allah and obey me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["وَمُصَدِّقًا","لِّمَا","بَيْنَ","يَدَىَّ","مِنَ","ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةِ","وَلِأُحِلَّ","لَكُم","بَعْضَ","ٱلَّذِى","حُرِّمَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","وَجِئْتُكُم","بِـَٔايَةٍ","مِّن","رَّبِّكُمْ","فَٱتَّقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","وَأَطِيعُونِ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-5-87-4","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjujete","en":"you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"},{"bs":"učinio ga je svetim","en":"he/it made it sacred"},{"bs":"zabranjeno je","en":"it was forbidden"}],"ref":"5:87","answerWord":"تُحَرِّمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3837a94235026acc33e1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Forbid not the good things which Allah hath made lawful for you, and transgress not, Lo! Allah loveth not transgressors.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","لَا","تُحَرِّمُوا۟","طَيِّبَٰتِ","مَآ","أَحَلَّ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُمْ","وَلَا","تَعْتَدُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَا","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-6-140-8","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjeno je","en":"it was forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranio je","en":"and he/it forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"}],"ref":"6:140","answerWord":"وَحَرَّمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/7fbc881337f6d58ae44a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They are losers who besottedly have slain their children without knowledge, and have forbidden that which Allah bestowed upon them, inventing a lie against Allah. They indeed have gone astray and are not guided.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["قَدْ","خَسِرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","قَتَلُوٓا۟","أَوْلَٰدَهُمْ","سَفَهًۢا","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","وَحَرَّمُوا۟","مَا","رَزَقَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱفْتِرَآءً","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","قَدْ","ضَلُّوا۟","وَمَا","كَانُوا۟","مُهْتَدِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-7-50-17","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranio ih je","en":"he/it forbade them (two)"},{"bs":"i zabranjeno je","en":"and it was forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranio je","en":"and he/it forbade"},{"bs":"i zabranili su","en":"and they forbade"}],"ref":"7:50","answerWord":"حَرَّمَهُمَا","answerSound":"audio/bccaf732a48c7987dc10.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the dwellers of the Fire cry out unto the dwellers of the Garden: Pour on us some water or some wherewith Allah hath provided you. They say: Lo! Allah hath forbidden both to disbelievers (in His guidance),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["وَنَادَىٰٓ","أَصْحَٰبُ","ٱلنَّارِ","أَصْحَٰبَ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ","أَنْ","أَفِيضُوا۟","عَلَيْنَا","مِنَ","ٱلْمَآءِ","أَوْ","مِمَّا","رَزَقَكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","قَالُوٓا۟","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","حَرَّمَهُمَا","عَلَى","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[17],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-9-29-9","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"zabranjuju","en":"they forbid"},{"bs":"i zabranjeno je","en":"and it was forbidden"},{"bs":"zabranili smo","en":"we forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjujete","en":"you (all) forbid"}],"ref":"9:29","answerWord":"يُحَرِّمُونَ","answerSound":"audio/e33f28d57e55e3994797.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Fight against such of those who have been given the Scripture as believe not in Allah nor the Last Day, and forbid not that which Allah hath forbidden by His messenger, and follow not the Religion of Truth, until they pay the tribute readily, being brought low.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["قَٰتِلُوا۟","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱللَّهِ","وَلَا","بِٱلْيَوْمِ","ٱلْءَاخِرِ","وَلَا","يُحَرِّمُونَ","مَا","حَرَّمَ","ٱللَّهُ","وَرَسُولُهُۥ","وَلَا","يَدِينُونَ","دِينَ","ٱلْحَقِّ","مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أُوتُوا۟","ٱلْكِتَٰبَ","حَتَّىٰ","يُعْطُوا۟","ٱلْجِزْيَةَ","عَن","يَدٍ","وَهُمْ","صَٰغِرُونَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-27-91-8","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"učinio ga je svetim","en":"he/it made it sacred"},{"bs":"zabranjeno je","en":"it was forbidden"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju ga","en":"and they forbid it"},{"bs":"zabranio je","en":"he/it forbade"}],"ref":"27:91","answerWord":"حَرَّمَهَا","answerSound":"audio/77ccdc6922d7db67daa8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Say): I (Muhammad) am commanded only to serve the Lord of this land which He hath hallowed, and unto Whom all things belong. And I am commanded to be of those who surrender (unto Him),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["إِنَّمَآ","أُمِرْتُ","أَنْ","أَعْبُدَ","رَبَّ","هَٰذِهِ","ٱلْبَلْدَةِ","ٱلَّذِى","حَرَّمَهَا","وَلَهُۥ","كُلُّ","شَىْءٍ","وَأُمِرْتُ","أَنْ","أَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"harrama-28-12-0","words":["verb:harrama"],"options":[{"bs":"i zabranili smo","en":"and we forbade"},{"bs":"zabranjujete","en":"you (all) forbid"},{"bs":"i zabranjuju ga","en":"and they forbid it"},{"bs":"zabranio je","en":"he/it forbade"}],"ref":"28:12","answerWord":"وَحَرَّمْنَا","answerSound":"audio/7cdf4be03d9a010a8629.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We had before forbidden foster-mothers for him, so she said: Shall I show you a household who will rear him for you and take care of him?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"zabraniti","en":"to forbid, to make unlawful"},"passage":["وَحَرَّمْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْمَرَاضِعَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","فَقَالَتْ","هَلْ","أَدُلُّكُمْ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَهْلِ","بَيْتٍ","يَكْفُلُونَهُۥ","لَكُمْ","وَهُمْ","لَهُۥ","نَٰصِحُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَرَّمَ"}},{"id":"khasafa-67-16-5","words":["verb:khasafa"],"options":[{"bs":"da učini da (zemlja) proguta","en":"(that) He makes (the earth) swallow"},{"bs":"pa smo dali da propadne","en":"so we made sink"},{"bs":"i pomračio se","en":"and he/it darkened"},{"bs":"dajemo da propadne","en":"we make sink"}],"ref":"67:16","answerWord":"يَخْسِفَ","answerSound":"audio/30bc2c67411095019ca6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have ye taken security from Him Who is in the heaven that He will not cause the earth to swallow you when lo! it is convulsed?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da propadne u zemlju; pomračiti se","en":"to make sink; to be eclipsed"},"passage":["ءَأَمِنتُم","مَّن","فِى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","أَن","يَخْسِفَ","بِكُمُ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","فَإِذَا","هِىَ","تَمُورُ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"خَسَفَ"}},{"id":"khasafa-28-81-0","words":["verb:khasafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo dali da propadne","en":"so we made sink"},{"bs":"da učini da (zemlja) proguta","en":"(that) He makes (the earth) swallow"},{"bs":"i pomračio se","en":"and he/it darkened"},{"bs":"dajemo da propadne","en":"we make sink"}],"ref":"28:81","answerWord":"فَخَسَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/aba02af7d2a85d62fb89.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So We caused the earth to swallow him and his dwelling-place. Then he had no host to help him against Allah, nor was he of those who can save themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da propadne u zemlju; pomračiti se","en":"to make sink; to be eclipsed"},"passage":["فَخَسَفْنَا","بِهِۦ","وَبِدَارِهِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","فَمَا","كَانَ","لَهُۥ","مِن","فِئَةٍ","يَنصُرُونَهُۥ","مِن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَا","كَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُنتَصِرِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"خَسَفَ"}},{"id":"khasafa-29-40-14","words":["verb:khasafa"],"options":[{"bs":"dali smo da propadne","en":"we made sink"},{"bs":"da učini da (zemlja) proguta","en":"(that) He makes (the earth) swallow"},{"bs":"dajemo da propadne","en":"we make sink"},{"bs":"i pomračio se","en":"and he/it darkened"}],"ref":"29:40","answerWord":"خَسَفْنَا","answerSound":"audio/a05b0abddc90184e067b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So We took each one in his sin; of them was he on whom We sent a hurricane, and of them was he who was overtaken by the (Awful) Cry, and of them was he whom We caused the earth to swallow, and of them was he whom We drowned. It was not for Allah to wrong them, but they wronged themselves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da propadne u zemlju; pomračiti se","en":"to make sink; to be eclipsed"},"passage":["فَكُلًّا","أَخَذْنَا","بِذَنۢبِهِۦ","فَمِنْهُم","مَّنْ","أَرْسَلْنَا","عَلَيْهِ","حَاصِبًا","وَمِنْهُم","مَّنْ","أَخَذَتْهُ","ٱلصَّيْحَةُ","وَمِنْهُم","مَّنْ","خَسَفْنَا","بِهِ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","وَمِنْهُم","مَّنْ","أَغْرَقْنَا","وَمَا","كَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","لِيَظْلِمَهُمْ","وَلَٰكِن","كَانُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَهُمْ","يَظْلِمُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"خَسَفَ"}},{"id":"khasafa-34-9-13","words":["verb:khasafa"],"options":[{"bs":"dajemo da propadne","en":"we make sink"},{"bs":"pa smo dali da propadne","en":"so we made sink"},{"bs":"da učini da (zemlja) proguta","en":"(that) He makes (the earth) swallow"},{"bs":"i pomračio se","en":"and he/it darkened"}],"ref":"34:9","answerWord":"نَخْسِفْ","answerSound":"audio/940f24372680faa7cf67.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not observed what is before them and what is behind them of the sky and the earth? If We will, We can make the earth swallow them, or cause obliteration from the sky to fall on them. Lo! herein surely is a portent for every slave who turneth (to Allah) repentant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da propadne u zemlju; pomračiti se","en":"to make sink; to be eclipsed"},"passage":["أَفَلَمْ","يَرَوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","مَا","بَيْنَ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","وَمَا","خَلْفَهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","إِن","نَّشَأْ","نَخْسِفْ","بِهِمُ","ٱلْأَرْضَ","أَوْ","نُسْقِطْ","عَلَيْهِمْ","كِسَفًا","مِّنَ","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَءَايَةً","لِّكُلِّ","عَبْدٍ","مُّنِيبٍ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"خَسَفَ"}},{"id":"khasafa-75-8-0","words":["verb:khasafa"],"options":[{"bs":"i pomračio se","en":"and he/it darkened"},{"bs":"da učini da (zemlja) proguta","en":"(that) He makes (the earth) swallow"},{"bs":"dajemo da propadne","en":"we make sink"},{"bs":"dali smo da propadne","en":"we made sink"}],"ref":"75:8","answerWord":"وَخَسَفَ","answerSound":"audio/9d25172391763892eb70.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And the moon is eclipsed","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"dati da propadne u zemlju; pomračiti se","en":"to make sink; to be eclipsed"},"passage":["وَخَسَفَ","ٱلْقَمَرُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"خَسَفَ"}}]